"product, and do not hesitate to duplicate and edit an existing product."
msgstr ""
"ສຶກສາເອກະສານຄູ່ມືຂອງພວກເຮົາ ເພື່ອກວດສອບການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງສຳລັບແຕ່ລະສິນຄ້າ, ແລະ ທ່ານສາມາດສຳເນົາ "
"ພ້ອມທັງແກ້ໄຂສິນຄ້າທີ່ມີຢູ່ແລ້ວໄດ້ທຸກເວລາ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Fasten your <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Purchases</font></"
"strong>. Keep track of your inventory, and follow your deliveries in the "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Inventory App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ເລັ່ງຂະບວນການ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ຈັດຊື້</font></strong> ຂອງທ່ານ"
"ໃຫ້ວ່ອງໄວຂຶ້ນ. ຕິດຕາມສະຕັອກສິນຄ້າ, ແລະ ຕິດຕາມການຈັດສົ່ງຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ໃນ <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Finally, use the <b>Allocation</b> button to assign the MO to the <b>Sales "
"Order</b>."
msgstr ""
"ສຸດທ້າຍ, ໃຊ້ປຸ່ມ <b>ການຈັດສັນ</b> ເພື່ອມອບໝາຍ MO ໃຫ້ກັບ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຂາຍ</b>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Follow your equipment status and maintenance with the <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Maintenance App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕາມສະຖານະອຸປະກອນ ແລະ ການບຳລຸງຮັກສາຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">ແອັບການບຳລຸງຮັກສາ</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Follow your planning and keep track of worked time in the <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Planning &amp; Timesheets Apps</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຕິດຕາມແຜນການເຮັດວຽກ ແລະ ບັນທຶກເວລາປະຕິບັດງານໄດ້ໃນ <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">ແອັບການວາງແຜນ &amp; ໃບບັນທຶກເວລາ</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"For this use case, open the David Patel quotation. You can see a complete "
"setup using all the products mentioned in the previous topic."
msgstr ""
"ສຳລັບຕົວຢ່າງການນຳໃຊ້ນີ້, ໃຫ້ເປີດໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຂອງ David Patel. ທ່ານຈະເຫັນການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ຄົບຖ້ວນໂດຍກາ"
"ນນຳໃຊ້ທຸກສິນຄ້າທີ່ໄດ້ກ່າວມາໃນຫົວຂໍ້ກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "From the David Patel quotation, we placed"
msgstr "ຈາກໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຂອງ David Patel, ພວກເຮົາໄດ້ສັ່ງ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:sale.order.template.line,name:custom_furniture.sale_order_template_line_3
msgid "Furnitures"
msgstr "ເຄື່ອງເຟີນິເຈີ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Go to the Shop Floor App and validate the first step of your production by "
"clicking on it. Continue with the other steps until you can register your "
"production."
msgstr ""
"ໄປທີ່ແອັບໜ້າໂຮງງານ (Shop Floor) ແລະ ຢືນຢັນຂັ້ນຕອນທຳອິດຂອງການຜະລິດໂດຍການກົດໃສ່ມັນ. ສືບຕໍ່ດຳເນີນ"
"ຂັ້ນຕອນອື່ນໆ ຈົນກວ່າທ່ານຈະສາມາດບັນທຶກຜົນການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານໄດ້."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "Hello there!"
msgstr "ສະບາຍດີ!"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you do not have a specific installation task or want to deliver it "
"separately, you can do it in the Inventory App."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານບໍ່ມີໜ້າວຽກການຕິດຕັ້ງສະເພາະ ຫຼື ຕ້ອງການຈັດສົ່ງແຍກຕ່າງຫາກ, ທ່ານສາມາດດຳເນີນການໄດ້ໃນແອັບສາງສິນ"
"ຄ້າ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you usually structure your quotations similarly, use the Quotation "
"Template feature. It will allow you to configure a set of products and "
"sections that will always be imported when you select it."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຈັດໂຄງສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາຄ້າຍຄືກັນເປັນປະຈຳ, ໃຫ້ໃຊ້ຄຸນສົມບັດແບບຮ່າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ. ມັນຈະຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່າ"
"ນຕັ້ງຄ່າຊຸດສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ໝວດໝູ່ຕ່າງໆ ທີ່ຈະຖືກດຶງຂໍ້ມູນເຂົ້າມາທຸກຄັ້ງທີ່ທ່ານເລືອກໃຊ້ມັນ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to execute a practical guided tour of this module, you should "
"Import demo data and try the Demo - Use Case. (In the next Knowledge Article)"
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໂມດູນນີ້ຕາມຂັ້ນຕອນແນະນຳຕົວຈິງ, ທ່ານຄວນນຳເຂົ້າຂໍ້ມູນທົດລອງ ແລະ ລອງໃຊ້ ຕົວຢ່"
"າງການນຳໃຊ້ - Demo. (ໃນບົດຄວາມຄັງຄວາມຮູ້ຖັດໄປ)"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"If you want to remove this part of your process, you can use reordering "
"rules. These will ensure a fluid replenishment based on minimum quantities "
"of each product or based on orders."
msgstr ""
"ຖ້າທ່ານຕ້ອງການຕັດຂັ້ນຕອນນີ້ອອກຈາກຂະບວນການເຮັດວຽກ, ທ່ານສາມາດນຳໃຊ້ກົດເກນການສັ່ງຊື້ຄືນໃໝ່. ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວ"
"ຍໃຫ້ການເຕີມເຕັມສິນຄ້າດຳເນີນໄປຢ່າງຕໍ່ເນື່ອງ ໂດຍອີງຕາມຈຳນວນຂັ້ນຕ່ຳຂອງແຕ່ລະສິນຄ້າ ຫຼື ອີງຕາມລາຍການສັ່ງ"
"ຊື້."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In <b>version 19.1</b>, this field uses <b>HTML</b>, making it easy to share "
"crucial context, including uploading <b>images</b>, adding <b>documents</b>, "
"or <b>linking</b> to relevant articles in the Knowledge app."
msgstr ""
"ໃນ <b>ລຸ້ນ 19.1</b>, ຫ້ອງຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຮອງຮັບ <b>HTML</b>, ເຮັດໃຫ້ສະດວກໃນການແບ່ງປັນຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນ, ລວມ"
"ທັງການອັບໂຫຼດ <b>ຮູບພາບ</b>, ເພີ່ມ <b>ເອກະສານ</b>, ຫຼື <b>ສ້າງລິ້ງ</b> ໄປຫາບົດຄວາມທີ່ກ່ຽວຂ້ອງ"
"ໃນແອັບຄັງຄວາມຮູ້ (Knowledge)."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:project.task.type,name:custom_furniture.project_task_type_19
msgid "In progress"
msgstr "ກຳລັງດຳເນີນການ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In the Purchase Apps, you can see all your Requests For Quotation, which are "
"ready to be sent to your providers. When you have confirmation that your "
"order has been placed, confirm each RFQ to continue the process."
msgstr ""
"ໃນແອັບການຈັດຊື້, ທ່ານສາມາດເບິ່ງໃບຂໍສະເໜີລາຄາທັງໝົດຂອງທ່ານ ທີ່ພ້ອມສົ່ງຫາຜູ້ສະໜອງສິນຄ້າແລ້ວ. ເມື່ອທ່ານໄດ້"
"ຮັບການຢືນຢັນວ່າໄດ້ສັ່ງຊື້ສິນຄ້າແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດຢືນຢັນແຕ່ລະ RFQ ເພື່ອດຳເນີນຂັ້ນຕອນຕໍ່ໄປ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"In this App, you can see that the delivery is not yet ready to be shipped, "
"as you currently don't have the necessary products. If you navigate to "
"Operations &gt; Replenishment, you will find the list of suggested purchase/"
"manufacture\n"
"        orders missing to complete this order. Select everything, and click "
"on \"Replenish\" &gt; \"Order.\""
msgstr ""
"ໃນແອັບນີ້, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນວ່າການຈັດສົ່ງຍັງບໍ່ພ້ອມທີ່ຈະສົ່ງເທື່ອ, ເນື່ອງຈາກປະຈຸບັນທ່ານຍັງບໍ່ມີສິນຄ້າທີ່ຈຳເປັນ. ຖ້າທ່ານ"
"ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ ການດຳເນີນງານ &gt; ການເຕີມເຕັມສິນຄ້າ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນລາຍການແນະນຳການຈັດຊື້/ການຜະລິດ\n"
"        ທີ່ຍັງຂາດຢູ່ເພື່ອເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ນີ້ສຳເລັດ. ໃຫ້ເລືອກທັງໝົດ, ແລ້ວກົດໃສ່ \"ເຕີມເຕັມ\" &gt; "
"\"ສັ່ງຊື້.\""

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:product.template,name:custom_furniture.product_product_2_product_template
msgid "Initial design consultation and space assessment"
msgstr "ການໃຫ້ຄຳປຶກສາການອອກແບບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການປະເມີນສະຖານທີ່"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:sale.order.template.line,name:custom_furniture.sale_order_template_line_5
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "ການຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:planning.role,name:custom_furniture.planning_role_1
msgid "Installer"
msgstr "ຊ່າງຕິດຕັ້ງ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:sale.order.template,name:custom_furniture.sale_order_template_1
msgid "Interior Design Project"
msgstr "ໂຄງການອອກແບບພາຍໃນ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "Inventory"
msgstr "ສາງສິນຄ້າ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:product.attribute.value,name:custom_furniture.product_attribute_value_6
msgid "Invisible"
msgstr "ເຊື່ອງໄວ້"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Invoice at the right time with the <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Invoice App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ອອກໃບຮຽກເກັບເງິນໃຫ້ຖືກເວລາດ້ວຍ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບການອອກໃບຮ"
"ຽກເກັບເງິນ</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Level up your Manufacture process with the <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">Manufacturing App</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຍົກລະດັບຂະບວນການຜະລິດຂອງທ່ານດ້ວຍ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບການຜະລິ"
"ດ</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage all your communication channels in one place with Odoo <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Marketing Automation</font></strong>, <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">Email Marketing</font></strong>,\n"
"                <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Social Media "
"Marketing</font></strong>, and <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">SMS "
"Marketing</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ຄຸ້ມຄອງທຸກຊ່ອງທາງການສື່ສານຂອງທ່ານໃນບ່ອນດຽວດ້ວຍ Odoo <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">ລະບົບການຕະຫຼາດອັດຕະໂນມັດ</font></strong>, <strong><font class=\"text-o-"
"color-1\">ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານອີເມວ</font></strong>,\n"
"                <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານສື່ສັງຄົມອອນລາ"
"ຍ</font></strong>, ແລະ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ການຕະຫຼາດຜ່ານ "
"SMS</font></strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your accounting easier than ever with a completely integrated "
"environment. (<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Accounting App</font></"
"strong>)"
msgstr ""
"ຈັດການວຽກບັນຊີຂອງທ່ານໄດ້ງ່າຍຂຶ້ນກວ່າທີ່ເຄີຍ ດ້ວຍລະບົບທີ່ເຊື່ອມໂຍງກັນຢ່າງສົມບູນ. (<strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບການບັນຊີ</font></strong>)"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Manage your employees and all your human resources using the <strong><font "
"class=\"text-o-color-1\">HR Suite.</font></strong>"
msgstr ""
