"several sources:"
msgstr ""
"ແອັບ <font class=\"text-o-color-1\"> <strong>CRM</strong> </font> ຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ທ່ານສາມາ"
"ດຮວບຮວມຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍຈາກລູກຄ້າທີ່ມີທ່າແຮງ ໂດຍການລວມເອົາຫຼາຍຊ່ອງທາງເຂົ້າກັນ:"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Manufacturing App comes with the Shop Floor app. This will provide a "
"specific view for your worker to keep track of any task in a particular Work "
"Center."
msgstr ""
"ແອັບການຜະລິດມາພ້ອມກັບແອັບໜ້າໂຮງງານ (Shop Floor). ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະຊ່ວຍສະແດງມຸມມອງສະເພາະໃຫ້ແກ່ພະນັກງາ"
"ນຂອງທ່ານ ເພື່ອຕິດຕາມທຸກໜ້າວຽກໃນແຕ່ລະສູນປະຕິບັດງານ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The Manufacturing App provides the production manager with a comprehensive "
"overview of products to be created and allows them to manage production by:"
msgstr ""
"ແອັບການຜະລິດຊ່ວຍໃຫ້ຜູ້ຈັດການຝ່າຍຜະລິດເຫັນພາບລວມທັງໝົດຂອງສິນຄ້າທີ່ຈະຕ້ອງຜະລິດ ແລະ ສາມາດຄຸ້ມຄອງການຜ"
"ະລິດໄດ້ໂດຍ:"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "The Project App offers three key functions:"
msgstr "ແອັບໂຄງການມີ 3 ໜ້າທີ່ຫຼັກ:"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The project template is scheduled for December 1st–31st, and the <b>\"Review "
"Customer Technical Information\"</b> task is set for December 1st–2nd. As a "
"result, every new project based on this template will have that\n"
"                        crucial initial task automatically scheduled to "
"occur <b>one month prior to the project's final completion date</b>, thereby "
"automating key deadline setting."
msgstr ""
"ແບບຮ່າງໂຄງການຖືກກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນວັນທີ 1–31 ທັນວາ, ແລະ ໜ້າວຽກ <b>\"ກວດສອບຂໍ້ມູນເຕັກນິກຂອງລູກຄ້າ\"</"
"b> ແມ່ນກຳນົດໄວ້ໃນວັນທີ 1–2 ທັນວາ. ດັ່ງນັ້ນ, ທຸກໆໂຄງການໃໝ່ທີ່ອີງຕາມແບບຮ່າງນີ້ ຈະມີໜ້າວຽກເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ\n"
"                        ທີ່ສຳຄັນດັ່ງກ່າວຖືກວາງແຜນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃຫ້ເກີດຂຶ້ນ <b>ໜຶ່ງເດືອນກ່ອນວັນທີສ"
"ຳເລັດໂຄງການ</b>, ເຊິ່ງເປັນການກຳນົດກຳນົດເວລາສຳຄັນແບບອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"The services <b>\"Concept development and 3D renderings\"</b> and "
"<b>\"Design presentation and revisions\"</b> automatically create <b>new "
"tasks</b> within the newly generated project. This allows the project to "
"combine\n"
"                <b>predefined tasks from the project template</b> with "
"<b>extra tasks added specifically from the quotation</b>. Furthermore, "
"because these services are configured with <b>\"Plan Services\"</b> "
"settings, a work <b>shift</b> is\n"
"                automatically generated in the project's planning system for "
"the specific role required by each service."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການ <b>\"ການພັດທະນາແນວຄວາມຄິດ ແລະ ການສະແດງພາບ 3D\"</b> ແລະ <b>\"ການນຳສະເໜີການອ"
"ອກແບບ ແລະ ການດັດແກ້\"</b> ຈະສ້າງ <b>ໜ້າວຽກໃໝ່</b> ພາຍໃນໂຄງການທີ່ສ້າງຂຶ້ນໃໝ່ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ. "
"ສິ່ງນີ້ເຮັດໃຫ້ໂຄງການສາມາດລວມເອົາ\n"
"                <b>ໜ້າວຽກທີ່ກຳນົດໄວ້ລ່ວງໜ້າຈາກແບບຮ່າງໂຄງການ</b> ເຂົ້າກັບ <b>ໜ້າວຽກເພີ່ມເຕີມທີ່"
"ເພີ່ມມາຈາກໃບສະເໜີລາຄາໂດຍສະເພາະ</b>. ນອກຈາກນັ້ນ, ເນື່ອງຈາກການບໍລິການເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກຕັ້ງຄ່າດ້ວຍ <b>"
"\"ວາງແຜນບໍລິການ\"</b>, ລະບົບຈະສ້າງ <b>ຜຽນວຽກ</b>\n"
"                ຂຶ້ນໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດໃນລະບົບການວາງແຜນຂອງໂຄງການ ສຳລັບຕຳແໜ່ງສະເພາະທີ່ແຕ່ລະບໍລິກ"
"ານຕ້ອງການ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"There are 4 different kinds of services available in this configuration:"
msgstr "ມີການບໍລິການ 4 ປະເພດທີ່ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່ານີ້:"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"These all go free in your current subscription; feel free to explore! 🙃"
msgstr ""
"ທັງໝົດນີ້ໃຊ້ໄດ້ຟຣີໃນແພັກເກດສະມາຊິກປະຈຸບັນຂອງທ່ານ; ເຊີນທົດລອງນຳໃຊ້ໄດ້ເລີຍ! 🙃"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"This subcontracted service (<b>\"Initial design consultation and space "
"assessment\"</b>) automatically triggers the creation of a <b>Purchase "
"Order</b>."
msgstr ""
"ບໍລິການຈ້າງຜູ້ຮັບເໝົາຊ່ວງນີ້ (<b>\"ການໃຫ້ຄຳປຶກສາການອອກແບບເບື້ອງຕົ້ນ ແລະ ການປະເມີນສະຖານທີ່\"</"
"b>) ຈະສັ່ງໃຫ້ສ້າງ <b>ໃບສັ່ງຊື້</b> ໂດຍອັດຕະໂນມັດ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "This will create two purchase orders and a manufacturing order."
msgstr "ສິ່ງນີ້ຈະສ້າງໃບສັ່ງຊື້ 2 ສະບັບ ແລະ ໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດ 1 ສະບັບ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "Time spent on the project."
msgstr "ເວລາທີ່ໃຊ້ໃນໂຄງການ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model:project.task.type,name:custom_furniture.project_task_type_18
msgid "To do"
msgstr "ສິ່ງທີ່ຕ້ອງເຮັດ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"To manage your inventory and everything you need to complete the order, "
"navigate to the Inventory App."
msgstr ""
"ເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງສາງສິນຄ້າ ແລະ ທຸກສິ່ງທີ່ທ່ານຕ້ອງການໃນການເຮັດໃຫ້ລາຍການສັ່ງຊື້ສຳເລັດ, ໃຫ້ໄປທີ່ແອັບສາງສິນຄ້າ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Upon Sales Order confirmation, the <b>\"Customer Project Management\"</b> "
"service initiates a new project using the <b>\"Customer Project Management\" "
"Template</b>. This template's power lies in its date logic:"
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອຢືນຢັນໃບສັ່ງຂາຍແລ້ວ, ບໍລິການ <b>\"ການຄຸ້ມຄອງໂຄງການລູກຄ້າ\"</b> ຈະເລີ່ມໂຄງການໃໝ່ໂດຍໃຊ້ <b>"
"ແບບຮ່າງ \"ການຄຸ້ມຄອງໂຄງການລູກຄ້າ\"</b>. ຈຸດເດັ່ນຂອງແບບຮ່າງນີ້ແມ່ນລະບົບການຄິດໄລ່ວັນທີ:"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <b>settings</b> in the <b>quotation section</b> to <b>control the "
"visibility</b> of prices and composition"
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <b>ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ</b> ໃນ <b>ໝວດໃບສະເໜີລາຄາ</b> ເພື່ອ <b>ຄວບຄຸມການສະແດງຜົນ</b> ຂອງລາຄາ "
"ແລະ ອົງປະກອບຕ່າງໆ"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM</font></strong> and the "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Sales Apps </font></strong>to manage "
"your customer relations, your opportunities and create stunning quotations."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບ CRM</font></strong> ແລະ "
"<strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບການຂາຍ </font></strong>ເພື່ອຄຸ້ມຄອງສາຍພົ"
"ວພັນລູກຄ້າ, ໂອກາດການຂາຍ ແລະ ສ້າງໃບສະເໜີລາຄາທີ່ໜ້າປະທັບໃຈ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">Website App</font></strong> "
"to create a contact form that will redirect all the requests to the <strong> "
"<font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM</font></strong>."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">ແອັບເວັບໄຊ</font></strong> ເພື່ອສ້າງແບບຟ"
"ອມຕິດຕໍ່ທີ່ຈະສົ່ງຕໍ່ທຸກໆຄຳຮ້ອງຂໍໄປຫາ <strong> <font class=\"text-o-color-1\">CRM</font></"
"strong>."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"Use the Planning in the Field Service <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">​"
"</font></strong> app to organize the work of your employees. Define which "
"project and when they have to work. Easily manage shift conflicts, workload, "
"and\n"
"        replacements in case of leave."
msgstr ""
"ໃຊ້ລະບົບການວາງແຜນໃນແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະໜາມ <strong><font class=\"text-o-color-1\">​</"
"font></strong> ເພື່ອຈັດສັນວຽກໃຫ້ພະນັກງານຂອງທ່ານ. ກຳນົດໂຄງການ ແລະ ເວລາທີ່ພວກເຂົາຕ້ອງປະຕິບັດງ"
"ານ. ຈັດການບັນຫາຜຽນວຽກຊ້ອນທັບ, ປະລິມານວຽກ, ແລະ\n"
"        ການເຮັດວຽກແທນໃນກໍລະນີລາພັກໄດ້ຢ່າງງ່າຍດາຍ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When a Manufacturing Order needs specific instructions for the production "
"team, add the details to the <b>Notes field</b> under the MO's "
"<b>Miscellaneous tab</b>. This information will then appear in the\n"
"                <b>Shop Floor app</b> for the employees to see."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອໃບສັ່ງຜະລິດຕ້ອງການຄຳແນະນຳສະເພາະສຳລັບທີມງານຜະລິດ, ໃຫ້ເພີ່ມລາຍລະອຽດລົງໃນ <b>ຫ້ອງໝາຍເຫດ</"
"b> ພາຍໃຕ້ແທັບ <b>ອື່ນໆ</b> ຂອງ MO. ຂໍ້ມູນນີ້ຈະໄປສະແດງໃນ\n"
"                <b>ແອັບໜ້າໂຮງງານ (Shop Floor)</b> ເພື່ອໃຫ້ພະນັກງານເຫັນ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "When the MO is complete, confirm it and then plan it."
msgstr "ເມື່ອ MO ສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ໃຫ້ກົດຢືນຢັນ ແລ້ວຈຶ່ງວາງແຜນການຜະລິດ."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"When you are done with your production, you can finally deliver the complete "
"order to your customer. To do so, navigate to the Field Service Apps. From "
"the Installation task, you can see all Products that require pick-up. Click "
"on the\n"
"        smart button and validate this picking."
msgstr ""
"ເມື່ອທ່ານຜະລິດສຳເລັດແລ້ວ, ທ່ານກໍສາມາດຈັດສົ່ງສິນຄ້າທັງໝົດໃຫ້ແກ່ລູກຄ້າໄດ້. ໂດຍໃຫ້ເຂົ້າໄປທີ່ແອັບບໍລິການພາກສະ"
"ໜາມ. ຈາກໜ້າວຽກການຕິດຕັ້ງ, ທ່ານຈະເຫັນສິນຄ້າທັງໝົດທີ່ຕ້ອງເບີກອອກມາ. ກົດໃສ່\n"
"        ປຸ່ມ Smart Button ແລ້ວຢືນຢັນການເບີກສິນຄ້ານີ້."

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid "Would you like to discuss your Odoo setup with us or go even further?"
msgstr ""
"ທ່ານຕ້ອງການປຶກສາຫາລືກ່ຽວກັບການຕິດຕັ້ງ Odoo ກັບພວກເຮົາ ຫຼື ຢາກຮຽນຮູ້ເພີ່ມຕື່ມບໍ່?"

#. module: custom_furniture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:custom_furniture.welcome_article_body
msgid ""
"You can access every installed App in your Odoo database on your main "
"dashboard."
msgstr ""
